Machine-learning model
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

model_tuning/ripls_embedding.onnx
model_tuning/ripls_embedding_tokenizer/

  Fine-tuned from sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, which is licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

  The fine-tuning data is synthetic, generated by
  model_tuning/generate_training_data.py from model_tuning/categories.json with
  a fixed seed. It contains no user data.

